<title>USA: Barnesville, Minn., won by John Kinnard.</title>
<headline>Barnesville, Minn., won by John Kinnard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G. Kinnard said it won $1.140 million of Barnesville, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.56 percent.</p>
</text>
